WEBVTT

00:08.633 --> 00:09.801
I won't let you escape.

00:20.270 --> 00:23.565
He's small and it's hard to land a blow.

00:28.153 --> 00:29.821
But I can do this!

00:34.743 --> 00:36.953
FEAR

00:51.551 --> 00:54.512
Demon Slayer: Swordsmith Village Arc

02:08.545 --> 02:12.924
Episode 7: Awful Villain

02:18.012 --> 02:20.682
That screeching! It hurts my ears!

02:21.641 --> 02:24.936
But I can do this! I'll sever his head!

02:31.609 --> 02:33.820
What? Behind me…

02:34.445 --> 02:36.156
Something's behind me.

02:38.408 --> 02:43.454
Delight, anger, sorrow, pleasure.
It doesn't smell like those four.

02:45.081 --> 02:47.041
What is it? What should I do?

02:51.254 --> 02:54.966
In any case, I have to cut his head!
If I do that, it'll be over!

02:59.429 --> 03:02.181
It's too hard. I can't cut any further.

03:02.765 --> 03:05.268
The effect of Nezuko's blood has worn off.

03:05.351 --> 03:07.186
Tanjiro, get out of the way!

03:07.270 --> 03:09.522
Damn it! I made the wrong decision.

03:11.149 --> 03:14.485
Genya can't shoot
because he's afraid it could hit me.

03:19.532 --> 03:20.408
This is bad!

03:21.200 --> 03:22.410
HATRED

03:22.493 --> 03:24.120
He's going to attack!

04:03.701 --> 04:04.535
Nezuko!

04:12.627 --> 04:14.045
Nezuko, are you all right?

04:18.633 --> 04:19.509
Nezuko!

04:23.054 --> 04:26.724
She's fine.
Her arm and leg have regenerated.

04:32.730 --> 04:35.275
You're such brutes who torment the weak.

04:37.485 --> 04:38.319
Nasty.

04:39.070 --> 04:40.029
Unpleasant.

04:41.614 --> 04:42.991
I can't take it anymore.

04:44.033 --> 04:45.660
UPPER - FOUR

04:52.041 --> 04:53.334
HATRED

04:55.086 --> 04:57.171
You awful villains.

04:59.215 --> 05:02.051
The sixth demon?

05:03.553 --> 05:06.597
There's another one? Give me a break!

05:08.308 --> 05:10.685
Wait, it's not the sixth one?

05:12.854 --> 05:14.272
Where are the four emotions?

05:15.189 --> 05:16.983
I can't sense those four demons.

05:20.570 --> 05:23.990
What the hell happened?
I don't know what's going on!

05:24.991 --> 05:28.077
That was the anger demon
just a second ago.

05:30.371 --> 05:35.543
I think when Tanjiro's sword
was about to cut that pipsqueak's head,

05:42.383 --> 05:44.802
the anger demon raised his hands.

05:46.763 --> 05:51.642
And in the blink of an eye, he grabbed
the delight and the pleasure demon.

05:52.977 --> 05:57.857
He absorbed those two demons
by crushing their flesh.

05:59.025 --> 06:01.235
In an instant,

06:01.319 --> 06:04.238
the anger demon
was already in front of Aizetsu.

06:05.198 --> 06:08.451
He opened his mouth as if to object,

06:09.452 --> 06:11.871
but he got absorbed
without even saying a word.

06:18.294 --> 06:22.173
Then, the anger demon's body
turned into that form!

06:28.221 --> 06:29.889
What the hell is that?

06:32.225 --> 06:35.937
Did he absorb three demons
and merge with them?

06:49.492 --> 06:52.078
He didn't split, but he got even younger.

06:53.162 --> 06:54.163
He's a child.

06:54.789 --> 06:58.709
It's a new form without the old man,
who seems to be the main body.

07:05.675 --> 07:08.094
This is bad! It's covering the main body.

07:08.177 --> 07:09.011
Wait!

07:23.443 --> 07:26.654
It's hard to breathe.
What an overpowering presence!

07:32.118 --> 07:33.327
My heart hurts.

07:41.961 --> 07:43.171
What?

07:44.839 --> 07:49.927
Do you have a problem with what I'm doing?

07:58.561 --> 08:02.940
Answer me, you villains.

08:08.946 --> 08:12.200
His voice creates a heavy pressure.

08:13.868 --> 08:16.370
I'm losing my strength.

08:17.497 --> 08:19.624
I can barely stand!

08:28.966 --> 08:29.800
Why…

08:32.261 --> 08:33.095
Why…

08:34.055 --> 08:37.225
Why are we… the villains?

08:39.185 --> 08:41.562
Because you torment the weak.

08:42.188 --> 08:45.525
You tried to kill
a small weakling earlier.

08:45.608 --> 08:48.778
Someone as small as the palm of your hand.

09:00.331 --> 09:06.045
How diabolical.
What you were doing was an atrocious deed.

09:08.798 --> 09:11.467
A small weakling, you say?

09:14.387 --> 09:16.514
Who is the weakling?

09:17.640 --> 09:18.808
Stop your nonsense!

09:19.684 --> 09:22.770
All of you demons reek of blood.

09:23.646 --> 09:26.524
I bet you've eaten one hundred
or even two hundred people!

09:28.067 --> 09:30.653
What did those people do to you?

09:31.988 --> 09:36.492
Did they do something
they had to pay for with their lives?

09:38.035 --> 09:42.081
Don't play the victim after you killed
and ate a lot of people!

09:42.832 --> 09:44.667
Your nature is twisted!

09:45.501 --> 09:47.086
What you've done is unforgivable!

09:49.171 --> 09:52.842
You devil! I will sever your head myself!

10:00.016 --> 10:04.937
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

10:05.021 --> 10:09.942
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

10:31.172 --> 10:36.302
That demon is so overpowering.
I can't even move.

10:40.222 --> 10:42.099
Are you done talking?

10:45.645 --> 10:48.356
I will sever your head myself!

10:50.107 --> 10:54.862
Was there any relative of yours
among the people I ate?

10:57.406 --> 10:58.532
No, but…

10:59.950 --> 11:03.037
Then it is none of your concern.

11:03.120 --> 11:04.997
It's not about that!

11:05.790 --> 11:11.337
I won't let you kill any more people!

11:12.546 --> 11:15.466
That's none of your concern either.

11:16.258 --> 11:18.969
You don't need a reason to help people!

11:20.888 --> 11:24.809
You are the brute
if you don't understand that!

11:50.501 --> 11:55.548
It's such a pleasure to see you
trying to look nonchalant!

11:55.631 --> 11:59.135
It gets my creative juices flowing!

12:04.223 --> 12:09.228
Honestly, I'd like to see how long
you can hold in there, but…

12:11.689 --> 12:15.818
I will check what is inside
this miserable shack first.

12:18.154 --> 12:22.491
I wonder what is so important
that you're trying to protect this place?

12:31.083 --> 12:33.127
With the remaining air in my lungs,

12:34.712 --> 12:36.922
I can still manage to deliver one blow.

12:39.258 --> 12:44.680
Mist Breathing, First Form:
Low Clouds, Distant Haze!

12:50.769 --> 12:53.355
I can't break it
even with this thrusting technique.

12:53.981 --> 12:56.650
I guess it's not surprising
with such a damaged sword.

13:03.073 --> 13:05.451
It's no use. I'm done for.

13:09.497 --> 13:11.749
I hope they send backup, but…

13:15.419 --> 13:18.839
Master, I'm going to die.

13:20.466 --> 13:23.511
Please send at least two Hashiras.

13:28.057 --> 13:29.391
Why do you think that?

13:36.732 --> 13:38.025
Why do you think that?

13:40.277 --> 13:42.905
No one knows what the future holds.

13:45.866 --> 13:46.700
What?

13:47.910 --> 13:48.744
It's not him.

13:50.246 --> 13:53.541
Tanjiro never said that to me.

13:56.835 --> 13:59.922
Who said it?

14:02.466 --> 14:03.425
Stop!

14:03.509 --> 14:04.969
I won't let you enter!

14:07.054 --> 14:10.307
Why? You know it's futile.

14:10.391 --> 14:14.979
Wait, do you think you can fight me?

14:18.941 --> 14:22.903
That is ridiculous.

14:30.286 --> 14:34.748
Why are you protecting
this miserable shack so desperately?

14:34.832 --> 14:39.587
Surely, the village chief
isn't here, is he?

14:56.562 --> 14:59.815
What an incredible steel.
Such an amazing sword.

15:02.359 --> 15:04.445
He's young.

15:04.528 --> 15:07.156
His body is not even 40 years old.

15:07.239 --> 15:09.074
I don't think he's the chief.

15:10.576 --> 15:14.413
What an amazing skill. Magnificent!

15:17.875 --> 15:20.377
Hey, human!

15:21.879 --> 15:26.508
Who made it?
What kind of swordsmith made this sword?

15:26.592 --> 15:30.804
Why didn't he engrave his name
but only a single letter?

15:30.888 --> 15:35.100
No, wait. I know. I get it now!

15:37.269 --> 15:38.562
This guy…

15:39.438 --> 15:42.066
What an amazing concentration!

15:42.149 --> 15:45.319
He's so absorbed
that he doesn't even notice me!

15:46.403 --> 15:48.989
I don't like this.

15:50.824 --> 15:54.828
Not even I have been
so concentrated in my life.

15:54.912 --> 15:58.082
I feel defeated as an artist.

16:04.880 --> 16:07.007
Stop! Haganezuka!

16:12.680 --> 16:13.681
Haganezuka?

16:14.264 --> 16:15.099
What?

16:25.067 --> 16:29.029
This man doesn't stop working!

16:30.322 --> 16:35.536
The reason why he didn't engrave his name
on such a fine sword…

16:35.619 --> 16:41.667
He forged this sword with determination
and only engraved a single letter on it.

16:41.750 --> 16:46.964
That means it's a sword
that has only one single purpose.

16:49.133 --> 16:50.300
Haganezuka!

16:53.762 --> 16:58.851
I don't like this.
Killing him would be easy,

16:58.934 --> 17:02.896
but I want to make him
let go of that sword.

17:03.397 --> 17:05.858
I want to break his concentration!

17:20.497 --> 17:23.834
My vision is fading.

17:25.627 --> 17:26.754
I'm going to die.

17:27.588 --> 17:29.006
I've run out of air.

17:31.300 --> 17:34.094
Do not decide what your own end will be.

17:37.139 --> 17:39.391
You never said that to me.

17:41.185 --> 17:43.896
It will work out somehow. Don't give up.

17:44.813 --> 17:46.732
Someone will come to help you.

17:48.734 --> 17:49.777
What are you saying?

17:50.486 --> 17:54.782
Counting on someone to help me?
That's the worst thing to do.

17:56.158 --> 17:59.745
There is only this much
that one person can do.

18:00.579 --> 18:03.499
That's why people work together.

18:06.960 --> 18:09.004
No one can help me.

18:10.297 --> 18:12.299
After all, everyone is weaker than me.

18:14.468 --> 18:17.346
I should have done better.

18:18.680 --> 18:20.265
But I made the wrong call.

18:21.433 --> 18:25.062
I unconsciously overestimated my strength,

18:25.979 --> 18:27.523
just because I am a Hashira.

18:30.192 --> 18:31.985
You weren't wrong, Muichiro.

18:32.903 --> 18:34.029
It's gonna be okay.

18:38.075 --> 18:40.994
I'm going to die
because I made several mistakes.

18:45.749 --> 18:46.917
Tokito!

18:47.417 --> 18:50.754
I won't let you die!
Tokito, hang in there!

18:51.380 --> 18:53.924
I'll get you out! I'll save you!

18:54.842 --> 18:59.429
Damn it! What is this?
It's like jelly, so gross!

19:00.264 --> 19:03.350
If I can't break it,
there's no way you could.

19:05.144 --> 19:08.063
There are more important things
you should prioritize.

19:09.398 --> 19:10.983
Protect the village chief.

19:13.610 --> 19:15.612
That's impossible for you, right?

19:16.530 --> 19:19.366
At least gather as many swords
as you can and escape.

19:28.417 --> 19:30.711
What are you doing? Look behind you!

19:31.295 --> 19:33.088
Look behind you!

19:39.511 --> 19:40.345
I'm bleeding!

19:40.429 --> 19:41.388
What are you doing?

19:41.471 --> 19:43.599
Don't just stay there! Run, hurry up!

19:43.682 --> 19:44.892
Quickly!

19:57.196 --> 19:59.907
The solar plexus…
He was stabbed right in a vital spot.

20:01.158 --> 20:02.159
He's going to die.

20:04.411 --> 20:08.081
No, you can't! Why don't you understand?

20:08.665 --> 20:11.585
Press on your wound!
Get out of here, quickly!

20:12.169 --> 20:15.589
Don't come to me! Don't try to help me!

20:16.215 --> 20:17.883
There's nothing you can do!

20:34.566 --> 20:39.821
When you help others,
it eventually comes back to you.

20:46.578 --> 20:50.916
Humans are creatures that can show

20:50.999 --> 20:54.336
an unbelievable strength
when they help others.

20:56.797 --> 20:57.881
Muichiro.

21:00.676 --> 21:02.970
Yes, I know.

21:09.935 --> 21:12.062
Mist Breathing, Second Form:

21:13.355 --> 21:15.023
Eight-Layered Mist!

21:24.408 --> 21:26.118
I remember now, Tanjiro.

21:28.662 --> 21:34.793
My father had the same red eyes as you do.

23:06.009 --> 23:07.010
DEMON SLAYER: SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC
NO. 7

23:13.517 --> 23:15.185
30KG

23:15.268 --> 23:20.774
So you've been doing this in secret.
But why do you need to do all of this?

23:21.274 --> 23:24.528
As long as the swordsman
is fighting for his life,

23:25.529 --> 23:32.410
the swordsmith must put
his whole soul into the sword he forges!

23:34.538 --> 23:37.290
It's time for the Taishō era secret.

23:37.374 --> 23:40.502
Remember the knives he was carrying
when he was chasing Tanjiro?

23:40.585 --> 23:42.879
Those knives are made
by Haganezuka himself.

23:42.963 --> 23:47.759
They're so incredibly sharp
that he's scared to use them for cooking.

23:47.843 --> 23:50.011
So they're useless then.

23:52.430 --> 23:53.849
Haganezuka!

23:53.932 --> 23:56.852
Scary! Scary!
Haganezuka, that's scary! It's dangerous!

23:56.935 --> 23:59.646
Next up, Episode 8:
"The 'Mu' of Muichiro."

23:59.855 --> 24:00.939
TO BE CONTINUED
